It was not the best idea to run towards the armed policemen. You turned your head back, and longingly looked at the fence. No man can jump that high.
But when you heard gunshots, your body did everything by itself. You took hard off the ground and rocketed into the air and landed on the other side of the fence. No time could be wasted before pursuers would find a roundabout way, and you ran through the narrow streets up hill and down dale, trying to get as far from there as possible. 

Like a hairy whirlwind you ran into a side street and nearly bumped into a struggling couple. It appeared that another crime was in progress. A sinewy skinny fellow wearing a mask and a leather jacket silently tried to snatch out a bag from a woman. She also silently tried to resist him. Your appearance has stuck them like a lightning charge. Woman's eyes became round, she immediately released her bag, and ran behind the corner, screaming.  The mugger stepped back to the wall, stretching forward his hand with a knife.